# API keys for the sources that need one. Rename this file to keys.txt.
#
# One `name = value` a line. Nothing in this program ever prints a key, and
# keys.txt is in .gitignore so it cannot reach the Mantle repo.
#
# Sign up (all free):
#   flickr      https://www.flickr.com/services/apps/create/
#   unsplash    https://unsplash.com/developers
#   pexels      https://www.pexels.com/api/
#   pixabay     https://pixabay.com/api/docs/
#   smithsonian https://api.data.gov/signup/
#   reddit      https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps   (an app, not just a key)
#
# Only fill in the ones you have. A source with no key is not offered, and
# says so on its own button rather than failing when you press Search.

